    // The Vassal: the Valiant's peer, an escort that keeps the sky over the fleet and lays
    // a lance on the ground or across at a ship. Against the Valiant: about its price and
    // the same lance damage a second at its reach; a lighter hull behind a small hull
    // shield, faster, and three twin repeaters that reach 200 m past its rotary at a little
    // more weight of fire. Model: `models::regency::space::vassal`. Tech 3 since 2026-10-10
    // (the key keeps its old tier for replays).
    (
        key: "regency_t2_space_frigate", name: "Vassal", role: "Escort Frigate", title: "Escort Frigate",
