    // The Scourge: the Regency's capital warship, the Dominion's peer. It fights from the
    // Dominion's height with the lance held from its core under it, six batteries in
    // ball mounts in pockets in its chines and a T3 seeker silo's worth of cells twice over.
    (
        key: "regency_t4_space_destroyer", name: "Scourge", role: "Destroyer", title: "Destroyer",
        tech: 4, categories: ["Air", "Space", "Experimental"], health: 170000,
        cost: (materials: 48000, energy: 658000, time: 208000),
        radius: 320, height: 130, footprint: (52, 20), hull: (330, 140), vision: 2400, radar: 3600,
        // Shots meet the long hull along its length, not a disc of its radius.
